 "title": "Speak: everyday sentences",
 "description": "Whole sentences you can use today. Sound first.",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "about_you",
   "title": "About you",
   "intro": [
    "Sentences you can use the first minute you meet someone.",
    "Mandarin word order is close to English: 'I am American' is wǒ shì Měiguó rén, word for word 'I am America person'.",
    "Say each sentence with its tones. The tone marks in the pinyin show how the voice moves."
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "id": "1",
     "front": "很高兴认识你",
     "reading": "hěn gāoxìng rènshi nǐ",
     "meaning": "nice to meet you",
     "hint": "Close to 'hun gow-shing run-shr nee'. Said when you first meet.",
     "card": "zh_sentences:1"
    },
    {
     "id": "2",
     "front": "我叫马克",
     "reading": "wǒ jiào Mǎkè",
     "meaning": "my name is Mark.",
     "hint": "Close to 'waw jyow Mah-kuh'. Swap in your own name.",
     "card": "zh_sentences:2"
    },
    {
     "id": "3",
     "front": "你叫什么名字",
     "reading": "nǐ jiào shénme míngzi",
     "meaning": "what is your name?",
     "hint": "Close to 'nee jyow shun-muh ming-dzuh'.",
     "card": "zh_sentences:3"
    },
    {
     "id": "4",
     "front": "我是美国人",
     "reading": "wǒ shì Měiguó rén",
     "meaning": "I am American.",
     "hint": "Close to 'waw shr May-gwaw run'. Swap in your own country.",
     "card": "zh_sentences:4"
    },
    {
     "id": "5",
     "front": "你是哪国人",
     "reading": "nǐ shì nǎ guó rén",
     "meaning": "which country are you from?",
     "hint": "Close to 'nee shr nah gwaw run'. nǎ means which.",
     "card": "zh_sentences:5"
    }
   ],
   "words": []
  },
  {
   "id": "questions",
   "title": "What and where",
   "intro": [
    "Three words carry many simple questions: shénme (what), nǎlǐ (where), duōshao qián (how much).",
    "To ask 'is it so?', add 吗 (ma) to the end of a statement.",
    "Zhè is this, nà is that."
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "id": "6",
     "front": "这是什么",
     "reading": "zhè shì shénme",
     "meaning": "what is this?",
     "hint": "Close to 'juh shr shun-muh'. Point at something as you say it.",
     "card": "zh_sentences:6"
    },
    {
     "id": "7",
     "front": "那是书",
     "reading": "nà shì shū",
     "meaning": "that is a book.",
     "hint": "Close to 'nah shr shoo'. Swap shū for any noun.",
     "card": "zh_sentences:7"
    },
    {
     "id": "8",
     "front": "厕所在哪里",
     "reading": "cèsuǒ zài nǎlǐ",
     "meaning": "where is the toilet?",
     "hint": "Close to 'tsuh-swaw dzai nah-lee'. One of the most useful sentences.",
     "card": "zh_sentences:8"
    },
    {
     "id": "9",
     "front": "这个多少钱",
     "reading": "zhège duōshao qián",
     "meaning": "how much is this?",
     "hint": "Close to 'juh-guh dwaw-shao chyen'. Point at the item.",
     "card": "zh_sentences:9"
    },
    {
     "id": "10",
     "front": "对，是的",
     "reading": "duì, shì de",
     "meaning": "yes, that's right.",
     "hint": "Close to 'dway, shr duh'.",
     "card": "zh_sentences:10"
    }
   ],
   "words": []
  },
  {
