  {
   "id": "wants",
   "title": "Wants and needs",
   "intro": [
    "To ask for something, say 'wǒ yào' (I want) and the thing, or 'qǐng gěi wǒ' (please give me).",
    "To say you are hungry or thirsty, add 了 (le) at the end: wǒ è le."
   ],
